# Optional VITE_STRAPI_URL: Strapi origin when the SPA is not served by Strapi (Playwright sets it
# for `vite preview`). Otherwise: dev → http://localhost:1337, prod → window.location.origin.
# Account-code filters, app title (`app.title`), workflow
# toggles, and publish policy come from Strapi (Settings + GET /api/backoffice/config).
# Seed per instance (httpyac; Full access API token in http-client.private.env.json):
#   npm run seed:http:kor:backoffice-features:local
